## Behavior moved

Moved from `inference.mjs` into `runtimeShutdownCoordinator.mjs`:

```text
VALID_SHUTDOWN_MODES
shutdown option validation
shutdown init-active check
shutdown request cancellation loop
shutdown worker-finalization flow
abort shutdown orchestration
drain shutdown orchestration
drain-with-timeout shutdown orchestration
scheduler-idle-or-timeout race helper
```

## Behavior intentionally not moved

The following remain in `inference.mjs` after this branch:

```text
public API exports
prompt admission
cancelPrompt()
initModel()
ensureModelReady()
runInitCycle()
resetSession() public wrapper
resetModel()
worker message router
shutdown_done router handling
worker error routing during shutdown
scheduler creation/ownership
workerBridge ownership
request creation
session reset coordinator composition
native boundary coordinator composition
request settlement helper composition
```

## Behavior preservation notes

Preserved shutdown option behavior:

```text
mode defaults to "abort"
supported modes remain "abort", "drain", and "drain-with-timeout"
unsupported mode error text is unchanged
drain-with-timeout still requires timeoutMs
timeoutMs must remain a positive integer
timeoutMs remains rejected for abort and drain modes
```

Preserved `shutdownRuntime()` preflight order:

```text
validateShutdownOptions(options)
resolveNativeOperationHardStopConfig(config)
assertRuntimeHealthy(lifecycle)
runtimeResetting rejection
runtimeShuttingDown rejection
active init rejection
active session reset rejection
mode-specific shutdown path
```

Preserved abort behavior:

```text
lifecycle.runtimeShuttingDown = true
scheduler.setReady(false)
cancelRequestsForShutdown("Runtime shutdown")
finalizeWorkerShutdown()
```

Preserved plain drain behavior:

```text
lifecycle.runtimeShuttingDown = true
scheduler.waitForIdle()
finalizeWorkerShutdown()
```

Plain drain still does not gain abort behavior. Already accepted queued/pending work remains allowed to complete.

Preserved drain-with-timeout behavior:

```text
lifecycle.runtimeShuttingDown = true
wait for scheduler idle or timeout
if timeout wins:
    scheduler.setReady(false)
    cancelRequestsForShutdown("Runtime shutdown timeout")
finalizeWorkerShutdown()
```

Preserved shutdown cancellation order:

```text
scheduler.cancelAll()
notifyRequestsCancellationRequested(canceled, reason)
for each canceled request:
    sendToWorker({ type: "cancel", id, sessionId, reason })
    cancelStream(req)
    traceCanceled(req)
    req.rejectDone(new Error(reason))
    traceDelete(req.id)
```

Preserved final worker shutdown order:

```text
resolveNativeOperationHardStopConfig(config)
create shutdown waiter
waitForShutdown.catch(() => {})
lifecycle.shutdownWaiter = { resolve, reject }
sendToWorker({ type: "shutdown" })
waitForNativeOperationBoundary(waitForShutdown, shutdownTimeoutMs, "shutdown", hardStopConfig)
if timed out: markRuntimeUnhealthy(lifecycle, { operation: "shutdown", timeoutMs }) and throw
clear session reset tracking
terminateWorker()
finally lifecycle.shutdownWaiter = null
```

